==========================================================================
LGPL-2.1-only: TagLib#
==========================================================================
- TagLib# (TagLibSharp, https://github.com/mono/taglib-sharp), which reads
  and writes tags. On a desktop, on the server and in the browser UI it
  ships as its own assembly, TagLibSharp.dll, replaceable as one. A phone app packs every assembly
  into itself (on iOS, compiled ahead of time into the app binary), so
  replacing it there means rebuilding Flower from its source with your
  TagLib#.

